hello and welcome to med simplified in  this video we will talk about five of  the best shampoos that you can use if  you are suffering from hair loss  hair loss is also known as alopecia in  dermatology  and it is a very very common problem  affecting millions of people across the  globe  hair loss can occur due to a variety of  reasons and in our previous videos we  have discussed in detail about why hair  fall occurs and the lifestyle changes  you can do to prevent hair loss so make  sure to watch that video first  hair loss of 100 hairs per day is normal  but it is very difficult to guess when  this limit of 100 hairs is crossed  here are some warning signs that you  should keep in mind if you are having  excessive hair loss  if you notice a bunch of hair while  combing or shampooing your hair  if you find hair almost every day on  your pillow  beddings or floor if your hair is  getting thinner and smaller  if you can see the bald scalp through  your shrinking mane  in case of males a receding of the  frontal hairline can be seen as  broadening of the forehead  in females you may notice a widening of  central parting and reduction in the  volume of the ponytail  you can also do a simple hair pull test  pull a bunch of approximately 100 hairs  from root to tip using moderate pressure  if you notice  more than 6 hairs then it is an  indicator that you are having  active hair fall regardless of the  reasons you can always use  a good anti-hair fall shampoo that  strengthens the hair and the hair  follicles  so you can control the rate of hair loss  let's start with the number one shampoo  that we have on our list which is the  kerastase tensorfeek  bain densai shampoo this anti-hair fall  shampoo from kerastase contains the  combination of stemoxedine and  hyaluronic acid  simoccidine is a topical hair loss  solution that was patented in 2012 by  the popular cosmetic brand  l'oreal it is a prolel 4 hydroxylase  inhibitor  also known as p4h enzyme inhibitor  previously l'oreal had an active  ingredient called  amin excel in their hair growth products  but eventually amin excel was replaced  by stem oxidine in  all of their products eventually  becoming the standard  now the researchers claim that by  inhibiting p4h enzyme  streamoxidine is able to stimulate new  stem cells in our hair follicles  therefore creating longer and denser  hair  hyaluronic acid will prevent a dry scalp  and hair from thinning and eventually  falling out  topical hyaluronic acid helps to lock in  water into the hair shaft  which provides hydration and moisture  for the hair that's thin  flat or even damaged it is a gentle  shampoo that will improve the density  and help to build hair strength i've  heard positive feedbacks from almost all  of my patients to whom i have  recommended this shampoo  number two indulika anti-hair fall  shampoo  the brand indulika started its venture  with hair oil  with time the hair oil became pretty  popular and recently indulika expanded  its hair care line by introducing their  anti-hair fall shampoo to the market  this shampoo contains ayurvedic  ingredients that help to control hair  fall  the most important ayurvedic component  of this shampoo is bhringraj  prangraj or bhringa is one of the oldest  remedies to treat hair problems  since ancient times this herb has been  used to treat premature grain  hair fall problems dandruff problems and  other hair related problems  for hair regrowth it is one of the most  trusted ingredients  it also contains amla which is full of  vitamin c  it helps to treat hair loss problems and  it is also a good solution for premature  graying  dandruff problems etc to maintain the  luster of hair amla is pretty popular  too  it contains tulsi also which helps in  controlling itching and dandruff  now this shampoo also contains henna  which helps to maintain ph balance for  the scalp  and also promotes hair growth and  conditions the hair  it also contains rosemary and shikakai  which are very good herbs for hair  growth  number three sane botanica biotin and  collagen  anti-hair fall shampoo this anti-airfall  shampoo  is sulfate free shampoo worth buying for  dry and damaged hair  prone to dandruff thinning and hair loss  it has vitamin b7  also known as biotin hydrolyzed collagen  oat  aloe vera sunflower oil avocado oil and  jojoba oil  that can nourish dry and damaged hair  biotin is also known as vitamin b7  and is found in few foods and nuts it  helps to improve hair texture and makes  them look healthier and fuller  it controls hair fall and helps in new  hair growth  number four tresemme hair fall defense  shampoo  this shampoo is known for its advanced  hair fall defense keratin technology  which is especially formulated for  damage and breakage prone hair  keratin is the main ingredient in the  outer layer of our hair  which is known for smoothing  straightening and controlling frizzy  hair  it helps to reinforce your hair strength  and prevents hair fall due to breakage  after hearing a positive review from  many people i can say that it does  control hair fall but  with regular usage it also works great  in eliminating frizz and hair remains  tangle free even without using a  conditioner  number five m caffeine green tea  hair fall control shampoo  green tea is considered to be good for  hair and this anti-hair fall shampoo  combines the goodness of green tea to  gently remove the toxins and debris from  hair  and improves the hair texture green tea  in this shampoo has antioxidant  properties  which fight the buildup of toxins due to  pollution and urban lifestyle  these antioxidants eliminate free  radicals and also prevent  sun damage caused by uv rays caffeine  and vitamin e in this shampoo also act  as  antioxidants to remove free radical  damage it also contains argon and olive  oils  which are very good for weak hair  you can find all the links to these  shampoos in the description box down  below  write down in the comments below that  which shampoo according to you has  worked  best for hair fall for you till now  thank you so much for watching and see  you in the next video
 

